---
import MainLayout from "@/layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Amirreza Shapouri — Backend Developer & SaaS Builder"
  description="The portfolio of Amirreza Shapouri, focused on backend development, web applications, and SaaS products."
>
  <main class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_75%_20%,rgba(139,92,246,0.13),transparent_38%)]"></div>
    <header class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-6">
      <a href="/en/" class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Amirreza Shapouri home">
        <span class="grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-violet-500 font-bold text-white">AS</span>
        <span class="font-semibold tracking-tight">Amirreza Shapouri</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm text-zinc-400 md:flex" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="transition hover:text-white" href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a class="transition hover:text-white" href="#about">About</a>
        <a class="transition hover:text-white" href="#services">Services</a>
        <a class="transition hover:text-white" href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="/fa/" class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-zinc-300 transition hover:border-violet-400 hover:text-white" lang="fa">فارسی</a>
    </header>

    <section class="relative mx-auto grid min-h-[78vh] w-full max-w-6xl items-center gap-14 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-violet-300">
          <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-violet-400 shadow-[0_0_18px_#8b5cf6]"></span>
          BACKEND DEVELOPER · SAAS BUILDER
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-[Manrope] text-4xl leading-[1.15] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-50 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Building Digital Products That <span class="text-violet-400">Solve Real Problems.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-400">
          I'm Amirreza Shapouri. I build backend systems and web applications, turning ideas into practical digital products.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="#projects" class="rounded-xl bg-violet-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-violet-950/30 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-violet-400">Explore Projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a href="#contact" class="rounded-xl border border-white/15 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-zinc-200 transition hover:border-violet-400/60 hover:bg-white/5">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-12 font-mono text-xs tracking-wide text-zinc-500">PYTHON <span class="text-violet-400">/</span> DJANGO <span class="text-violet-400">/</span> POSTGRESQL</p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-lg">
        <div class="absolute -inset-8 rounded-[2rem] bg-violet-500/10 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111119]/95 shadow-2xl shadow-black/40">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-4">
            <div class="flex gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></span></div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500">solution.py</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-600">•••</span>
          </div>
          <pre class="overflow-x-auto p-6 text-sm leading-8"><code><span class="text-violet-300">class</span> <span class="text-sky-200">DigitalProduct</span>:
    <span class="text-violet-300">def</span> <span class="text-amber-200">__init__</span>(self, idea):
        self.idea = idea

    <span class="text-violet-300">def</span> <span class="text-amber-200">build</span>(self):
        <span class="text-violet-300">return</span> <span class="text-emerald-300">"Real-world solution"</span>

<span class="text-zinc-500"># Turning ideas into useful software.</span></code></pre>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white/10 px-5 py-3 text-xs text-zinc-500">
            <span>Python</span><span class="font-mono">Ready to build <span class="text-violet-400">●</span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-7 -left-5 hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#171720] px-4 py-3 text-xs text-zinc-300 shadow-xl sm:block">
          <span class="mr-2 text-violet-400">✳</span> Thoughtful engineering
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-12 px-6 py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-violet-300">SELECTED WORK</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Projects built to solve problems.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-zinc-400">A selection of digital products and experiments. Detailed project stories are coming next.</p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-violet-400/40">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-violet-300">01 / WEB DEVELOPMENT</span><span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-emerald-300">Live</span></div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">ElvoWood</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400">A digital catalog experience for a furniture brand, focused on presenting products and strengthening its online presence.</p>
          <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500">Python · Django · PostgreSQL</p>
          <a class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-violet-300 hover:text-violet-200" href="https://elvowood.ir/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Visit live project ↗</a>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-violet-400/40">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-violet-300">02 / SAAS DEVELOPMENT</span><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-amber-300">In development</span></div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">Gym Management SaaS</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-zinc-400">A multi-tenant platform for managing gym operations, memberships, attendance, staff, and payments.</p>
          <p class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500">Python · Django · PostgreSQL</p>
          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex text-sm text-zinc-500">Case study coming soon</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-12 border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-violet-300">ABOUT</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold text-white">Engineering with purpose.</h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-400">I'm focused on backend development and building useful web products. I enjoy turning business requirements into clear, maintainable software and continuously strengthening my engineering foundations.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="services" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-12 border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-20">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-violet-300">WHAT I DO</p>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {["Backend Development", "Web Applications", "SaaS Products", "API Development"].map((item, index) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-5">
            <span class="font-mono text-sm text-violet-300">0{index + 1}</span>
            <h3 class="mt-5 font-semibold text-zinc-100">{item}</h3>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl scroll-mt-12 border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-20">
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-violet-400/20 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(139,92,246,0.16),transparent_55%)] p-8 sm:p-12">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-violet-300">GET IN TOUCH</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Have an idea? Let's build something meaningful.</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-zinc-400">I'm open to thoughtful conversations, collaborations, and opportunities.</p>
        <a href="mailto:hello@amirrezashapouri.com" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-violet-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-violet-400">Contact me ↗</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-3 border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-8 text-sm text-zinc-500 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Amirreza Shapouri</span>
      <span>Designed with clarity. Built with purpose.</span>
    </footer>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
